#
# RATCHET, not a freeze: the four routes that exist today (the seam's price fallback and the
# audit module's curl) are frozen in KNOWN_ROUTES and this gate ignores them. It fails on a
# NEW route, and on a frozen entry that is no longer real, so the debt can only shrink. The
